        <section id="the-rights-of-individuals-with-autism"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          The rights of individuals with autism
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Legislation and guidance as we have discussed previously support the rights and best interests of people with autism but how can these rights be promoted to the wider public. Rights include independence, individuality, making own choices, fair and equal treatment, respect and dignity. Individuals with autism and their families express that increasing public understanding of autism is the most important thing alongside improving social care, education and access to diagnosis.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/ua/ua_u2_s2_p2_image.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
